  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slice the chicken thinly.</li><li>Slice the mushrooms.</li><li>Chop the bok choy, keeping <b>stems and leaves separate</b>.</li><li>Finely chop garlic and ginger; slice the spring onion, keeping <b>whites and greens separate</b>.</li><li>Mix the sauce in a small bowl:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>soy sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2.25\">2¼ tsp</span></span></li><li>oyster sauce <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2.25\">2¼ tsp</span></span></li><li>mirin <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tsp</span></span></li><li>sake <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tsp</span></span></li><li>rice vinegar <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>water <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tbsp</span></span></li><li>black or white pepper <span class=\"amt\">a pinch</span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Prep everything",
