   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Add the noodles, sauce and chicken.</li><li><b>Gently lift and fold</b> for roughly 1–2 minutes, until the noodles are tender and coated.</li><li>Add water a tablespoon at a time if they remain firm but the pan is drying out.</li></ul>",
